  "### GCC compatibility",
  "lui $t1,%hi(label)	lui RG1, LH4	#Load Upper Address : Set $t1 to the upper 16 bits of label's address, adjusted so that a following %lo lands on the label. Pairs with an instruction taking %lo(label)($t1)",
